    "Id": "vehicledef_Hamilton",
    "Name": "Hamilton MBT",
    "Details": "Trading speed for armor and raw fire power, the 65 ton Hamilton was the heaviest of a trio of 2604 vintage SLDF armored units. 14.5 tons of armor and a Gauss Rifle supported by 5 Medium lasers poses a deadly threat to Mechs and other vehicles. The inclusion of so much advanced technology would render the Hamilton extinct by the end of the 2nd Succession War.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 3/5 hexes / 90/150 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       305     35\n<b>Left</b>         250     35\n<b>Right</b>       250     35\n<b>Rear</b>        195     35\n<b>Turret</b>      250     35\n\n<b>Total</b>      1250    175</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>",
    "Icon": "Marsden"
  },
